      "cat-harness:section": "Where the beans are",
      "prov:value": "It lives on a branch per graph, `cat/<harness>/beans` (for this harness `cat/cat-harness/beans`), declared by the `beans` entry's `source` in `cat-harness.json` ([state-branch proposal](../../../docs/proposals/state-branch-2026-10-02.md)).",
